# Legacy media at repo root: not served (Dockerfile only COPYs public/), but
# ~28 MB of the ~30 MB build context without this entry (docs/BILDER.md).
# Slows every `docker build .` (build-and-push-image.yml, test-docker-setup.yml,
# Render autoDeploy) for bytes that never reach the image.
RadioStudio.mov
DJPult.gif
JesseJayBanner.mov
